  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Metadata and tags are now rendered from the first log event written to a new blob, so event-based layouts like ${event-properties} work (#212)\n- Changed: a tag that renders empty is now skipped unless includeEmptyValue=\"true\" (previously sent as an empty value) (#212)\n- Fixed whole-batch loss when a rendered tag or metadata value breaks Azure's rules: invalid characters are replaced with '_', metadata values are trimmed and tag values truncated to 256 chars (#214, #215)\n- Fixed whole-batch loss when Azure rejects metadata or tags (invalid name, more than 10 tags, 8 KB metadata limit, SAS without tag permission): the blob is now created without them and an error is logged (#214)\n\nDocs: https://github.com/JDetmar/NLog.Extensions.AzureStorage/blob/master/src/NLog.Extensions.AzureBlobStorage/README.md",
